      "exampleBody": "If you want to craft a specific gadget, add it as a goal. The visualizer shows the full tree from the final item down to base materials like Circuit Boards or Chemicals. When you find a topside item during a raid, you can quickly check which materials it salvages into and decide whether it is worth the inventory space.",
